      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "We install all three with Helm charts, but no helm command. k3s has a Helm controller built in: a HelmChart resource says what to install, and k3s does it."
        },
        {
          "text": "This one names the chart's repository, the chart, a pinned version, and the namespace to install it in."
        },
        {
          "text": "Then come the chart's values. Monolithic mode runs all of Loki in one pod, plenty for a cluster this size."
        },
        {
          "text": "And it keeps its data as plain files on disk.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.3
        }
      ]
