        {
          "text": "It points at each container's files, by the pod's ID, the same path we just looked at."
        },
        {
          "text": "It tails them, picking up where it left off after a restart."
        },
        {
          "text": "The cri stage strips off the timestamp and stream name that containerd put in front.",
          "say": "The C R I stage strips off the timestamp and stream name that containerd put in front."
        },
