    {
      "id": "explore",
      "type": "terminal",
      "title": "Grafana: Explore, Loki",
      "prompt": ">",
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 1,
          "command": "{namespace=\"golinks\"} |= \"database not reachable\"",
          "output": [
            "14:52:24  golinks-5f8b6c7d9d-p2rnm  {\"time\":\"2026-11-02T14:52:24Z\",\"level\":\"WARN\",\"msg\":\"database not reachable\",\"err\":\"no such host\"}",
            "14:52:23  golinks-5f8b6c7d9d-k4xzt  {\"time\":\"2026-11-02T14:52:23Z\",\"level\":\"WARN\",\"msg\":\"database not reachable\",\"err\":\"no such host\"}",
            "14:52:19  golinks-5f8b6c7d9d-p2rnm  {\"time\":\"2026-11-02T14:52:19Z\",\"level\":\"WARN\",\"msg\":\"database not reachable\",\"err\":\"no such host\"}",
            "14:52:18  golinks-5f8b6c7d9d-k4xzt  {\"time\":\"2026-11-02T14:52:18Z\",\"level\":\"WARN\",\"msg\":\"database not reachable\",\"err\":\"no such host\"}"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "In Grafana's Explore view, we query Loki in its own language, LogQL."
        },
        {
          "text": "The part in braces picks streams by label: everything from the golinks namespace. Then we keep only lines that contain database not reachable."
        },
        {
          "text": "And there's the outage from Episode 6, from both pods at once. Alloy read each file from the start, so even lines from before it was installed are here.",
          "senses": {
            "read": "past"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Loki indexes only the labels, not the text. That keeps it small and cheap, and the text is searched when you ask.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "delete",
