      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You might ask: why not have the app write log files to a PersistentVolume?"
        },
        {
          "text": "Each replica would need its own file, and its own volume."
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing would rotate them or search them."
        },
        {
          "text": "And kubectl logs would stop working. Standard output, plus an agent on each node, is simpler on every count.",
          "pauseAfter": 0.4
        }
      ]
